OL,3,GNEWSAMen fined for dumping sofas in car
OL,4,Apark
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been fined #800 each after
OL,7,Fthey illegally dumped two sofas in a
OL,8,Fcar park.
OL,10,FThe fly-tipping took place at Beck
OL,11,FGardens, a housing association property
OL,12,Fin Grantham on 26 April, according to
OL,13,Fvideo footage.
OL,15,FDetails of the vehicle involved were
OL,16,Fpassed to South Kesteven District
OL,17,FCouncil which allowed them to identify
OL,18,Fthe two men responsible.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
