OL,3,GNEWSAMen fined for dumping sofas in car
OL,4,Apark
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Rhys Baker, cabinet member
OL,7,Ffor environment and waste, said:
OL,8,F"Fly-tipping has a detrimental impact
OL,9,Fon our communities and is an offence we
OL,10,Ftake very seriously."
